<Slide style={{ background: '#F5F1E6', padding: '48px 64px', fontFamily: '宋体' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end', height: 72 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>末句：拖长，还是收住</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>环节五 · 任务三</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
  <Box style={{ marginTop: 20, padding: '24px 40px', background: 'rgba(31,58,52,0.05)' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>这次第，怎一个愁字了得！</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, marginTop: 28, height: 180 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, border: '1px solid rgba(31,58,52,0.35)', padding: 24, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34' }}>读法 A：拖长</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B', marginTop: 12 }}>把“了得”放开，声音散出去</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, border: '1px solid rgba(180,85,45,0.5)', padding: 24, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B4552D' }}>读法 B：收住</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B', marginTop: 12 }}>把“得”压实，声音咽回去</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#1F3A34', marginTop: 24 }}>选一种，说一句“为什么”。</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, marginTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(31,58,52,0.2)', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 8 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>《声声慢》· 李清照</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#B4552D' }}>14/16</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>